# Kafka 组件集成指南

> 本文档将指导你一步步完成 Kafka 消息队列组件的集成。

---

## 📋 前置条件

- [ ] 你的应用已经使用 `go-ygctl new http` 创建
- [ ] 你有一个可用的 Kafka 集群
- [ ] Go 版本 >= 1.21

---

## 🚀 Step 1: 添加配置

```yaml
kafka:
  brokers:
    - "localhost:9092"
  version: "3.8.0"
  client_id: "your-app"
{{- if or (eq .Config.use_case "producer") (eq .Config.use_case "both")}}
  producer:
    enabled: true
    required_acks: 1
    timeout: 10s
    compression: "none"
{{- end}}
{{- if or (eq .Config.use_case "consumer") (eq .Config.use_case "both")}}
  consumer:
    enabled: true
    group_id: "your-app-consumer"
    topics:
      - "{{.Config.topic_name}}"
    auto_commit: true
{{- end}}
{{- if .Config.need_auth}}
  sasl:
    enabled: true
    mechanism: "PLAIN"
    username: "your-username"
    password: "your-password"
{{- end}}
```

---

## 🚀 Step 2: 注册组件

```go
import "github.com/KOMKZ/go-yogan-framework/kafka"

app.Register(
    kafka.NewComponent(),
)
```

---

## 🚀 Step 3: 发送消息示例

```go
kafkaComp, _ := app.GetRegistry().Get(component.ComponentKafka)
manager := kafkaComp.(*kafka.Component).GetManager()

// 发送消息
err := manager.SendMessage(ctx, "{{.Config.topic_name}}", "key", []byte("hello world"))
```

